# A keyword counter gives its keyword in layer 6 at the timestamp of its counters (CR 122.1b, 613.1f, 613.7c), so an effect
# that makes the permanent lose all abilities afterwards takes it: the counter stays, the keyword goes.
# Arwen's ability puts a +1/+1 counter and a lifelink counter on Ornithopter and it gains indestructible until end of turn; then
# Oko's +1 makes Ornithopter a 3/3 Elk that loses all abilities, the lifelink of the earlier counter and the earlier
# indestructible with them. The +1/+1 counter still counts (layer 7c): a 4/4.
# Bot1 turn 1 plays the artifacts; on turn 3, with the Ornithopter drawn: Black Lotus (GGG) and Mox Pearl pay Arwen {1}{G}{W} (a G left over), that G, Mox Sapphire and Mox Ruby pay
# Oko {1}{G}{U}, and Mox Emerald pays Arwen's {1}.

